Copyright: Copyright (c) 2026 Carmine Paolino (Plenty UG)
ShortDescription: Share the folders you choose with Chat with Work, read-only.
Description: |-
  The Chat with Work Local Agent (cww) lets the Chat with Work assistant search and read the folders you
  choose on this computer, and nothing else. It answers four read-only tools over one outbound WebSocket,
  keeps its full-text index on your machine, and never shares secrets such as keys, .env files or password
  databases, even inside a shared folder. Every request is written to a local audit log.
Moniker: cww
